  "scenes": [
    {
      "scene_id": "S01",
      "composition_source": "S01",
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 176,
      "duration_frames": 176,
      "start_seconds": 0.0,
      "end_seconds": 5.866667,
      "spoken_text": "In November 1975, a massive cargo ship called the Edmund Fitzgerald was crossing",
      "first_word": "In",
      "last_word": "crossing"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S02",
      "composition_source": "S02",
      "start_frame": 176,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 348,
      "duration_frames": 172,
      "start_seconds": 5.866667,
      "end_seconds": 11.6,
      "spoken_text": "Lake Superior. On board were 29 people and more than 26,000 tons of",
      "first_word": "Lake",
      "last_word": "of"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S03",
      "composition_source": "S03",
      "start_frame": 348,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 514,
      "duration_frames": 166,
      "start_seconds": 11.6,
      "end_seconds": 17.133333,
      "spoken_text": "iron ore. The next day, the ship disappeared during a storm. No one heard a",
      "first_word": "iron",
      "last_word": "a"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S04",
      "composition_source": "S04",
      "start_frame": 514,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 641,
      "duration_frames": 127,
      "start_seconds": 17.133333,
      "end_seconds": 21.366667,
      "spoken_text": "distress call. And just minutes before it is believed to have gone down,",
      "first_word": "distress",
      "last_word": "down,"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S05",
      "composition_source": "S05",
      "start_frame": 641,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 766,
      "duration_frames": 125,
      "start_seconds": 21.366667,
      "end_seconds": 25.533333,
      "spoken_text": "the crew was still answering radio calls from the bridge. What happened",
      "first_word": "the",
      "last_word": "happened"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S06",
      "composition_source": "S06",
      "start_frame": 766,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 936,
      "duration_frames": 170,
      "start_seconds": 25.533333,
      "end_seconds": 31.2,
      "spoken_text": "between that final conversation and the ship's disappearance remains unknown to this day.",
      "first_word": "between",
      "last_word": "day."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S07",
      "composition_source": "S07",
      "start_frame": 936,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1064,
      "duration_frames": 128,
      "start_seconds": 31.2,
      "end_seconds": 35.466667,
      "spoken_text": "The Edmund Fitzgerald left the port of Superior on November 9. Its",
      "first_word": "The",
      "last_word": "Its"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S08",
      "composition_source": "S08",
      "start_frame": 1064,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1234,
      "duration_frames": 170,
      "start_seconds": 35.466667,
      "end_seconds": 41.133333,
      "spoken_text": "destination was the Detroit area, where it was supposed to deliver its cargo after crossing Lake Superior.",
      "first_word": "destination",
      "last_word": "Superior."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S09",
      "composition_source": "S09",
      "start_frame": 1234,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1412,
      "duration_frames": 178,
      "start_seconds": 41.133333,
      "end_seconds": 47.066667,
      "spoken_text": "For a ship more than 200 meters long, this was another routine voyage across the Great Lakes.",
      "first_word": "For",
      "last_word": "Lakes."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S10",
      "composition_source": "S10",
      "start_frame": 1412,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1556,
      "duration_frames": 144,
      "start_seconds": 47.066667,
      "end_seconds": 51.866667,
      "spoken_text": "Another freighter, the Arthur M. Anderson, was heading in the same direction.",
      "first_word": "Another",
      "last_word": "direction."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S11",
      "composition_source": "S11",
      "start_frame": 1556,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1700,
      "duration_frames": 144,
      "start_seconds": 51.866667,
      "end_seconds": 56.666667,
      "spoken_text": "The two ships stayed in radio contact. As the weather began to deteriorate,",
      "first_word": "The",
      "last_word": "deteriorate,"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S12",
      "composition_source": "S12",
      "start_frame": 1700,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 1862,
      "duration_frames": 162,
      "start_seconds": 56.666667,
      "end_seconds": 62.066667,
      "spoken_text": "both changed course toward the Canadian shore, hoping it would offer some protection from the waves.",
      "first_word": "both",
      "last_word": "waves."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S13",
      "composition_source": "S13",
      "start_frame": 1862,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 2013,
      "duration_frames": 151,
      "start_seconds": 62.066667,
      "end_seconds": 67.1,
      "spoken_text": "But on November 10, the storm grew stronger. The wind shifted direction,",
      "first_word": "But",
      "last_word": "direction,"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S14",
      "composition_source": "S14",
      "start_frame": 2013,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 2187,
      "duration_frames": 174,
      "start_seconds": 67.1,
      "end_seconds": 72.9,
      "spoken_text": "and enormous waves built up on the eastern side of the lake. Snow reduced visibility.",
      "first_word": "and",
      "last_word": "visibility."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S15",
      "composition_source": "S15",
      "start_frame": 2187,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 2355,
      "duration_frames": 168,
      "start_seconds": 72.9,
      "end_seconds": 78.5,
      "spoken_text": "Both ships were now trying to reach the more sheltered waters of Whitefish Bay. That afternoon,",
      "first_word": "Both",
      "last_word": "afternoon,"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S16",
      "composition_source": "S16",
      "start_frame": 2355,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 2518,
      "duration_frames": 163,
      "start_seconds": 78.5,
      "end_seconds": 83.933333,
      "spoken_text": "the Fitzgerald reported damage. Part of its deck railing had been damaged, there were problems with its",
      "first_word": "the",
      "last_word": "its"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S17",
      "composition_source": "S17",
      "start_frame": 2518,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 2693,
      "duration_frames": 175,
      "start_seconds": 83.933333,
      "end_seconds": 89.766667,
      "spoken_text": "ventilation equipment, and the ship had developed a list. Its pumps were running. Later,",
      "first_word": "ventilation",
      "last_word": "Later,"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S18",
      "composition_source": "S18",
      "start_frame": 2693,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 2861,
      "duration_frames": 168,
      "start_seconds": 89.766667,
      "end_seconds": 95.366667,
      "spoken_text": "its radars failed. The Fitzgerald was sailing ahead, while the Anderson followed behind,",
      "first_word": "its",
      "last_word": "behind,"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S19",
      "composition_source": "S19",
      "start_frame": 2861,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 3029,
      "duration_frames": 168,
      "start_seconds": 95.366667,
      "end_seconds": 100.966667,
      "spoken_text": "helping over the radio by reporting the ship's position relative to the shore and other vessels. That",
      "first_word": "helping",
      "last_word": "That"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S20",
      "composition_source": "S20",
      "start_frame": 3029,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 3203,
      "duration_frames": 174,
      "start_seconds": 100.966667,
      "end_seconds": 106.766667,
      "spoken_text": "evening, the Anderson contacted the crew again and asked how they were managing their problems. The",
      "first_word": "evening,",
      "last_word": "The"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S21",
      "composition_source": "S21",
      "start_frame": 3203,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 3377,
      "duration_frames": 174,
      "start_seconds": 106.766667,
      "end_seconds": 112.566667,
      "spoken_text": "reply from the Fitzgerald was simple: We are holding our own. That was the last known radio",
      "first_word": "reply",
      "last_word": "radio"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S22",
      "composition_source": "S22",
      "start_frame": 3377,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 3556,
      "duration_frames": 179,
      "start_seconds": 112.566667,
      "end_seconds": 118.533333,
      "spoken_text": "contact. Soon afterward, the Fitzgerald's radar echo disappeared from the screen. When",
      "first_word": "contact.",
      "last_word": "When"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S23",
      "composition_source": "S23",
      "start_frame": 3556,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 3731,
      "duration_frames": 175,
      "start_seconds": 118.533333,
      "end_seconds": 124.366667,
      "spoken_text": "visibility improved, its lights were gone too. Repeated radio calls went unanswered.",
      "first_word": "visibility",
      "last_word": "unanswered."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S24",
      "composition_source": "S24",
      "start_frame": 3731,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 3899,
      "duration_frames": 168,
      "start_seconds": 124.366667,
      "end_seconds": 129.966667,
      "spoken_text": "The Anderson reported the disappearance to the Coast Guard. Then, after reaching sheltered waters,",
      "first_word": "The",
      "last_word": "waters,"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S25",
      "composition_source": "S25",
      "start_frame": 3899,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 4028,
      "duration_frames": 129,
      "start_seconds": 129.966667,
      "end_seconds": 134.266667,
      "spoken_text": "the freighter turned around and headed back into the storm to help with the search.",
      "first_word": "the",
      "last_word": "search."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S26",
      "composition_source": "S26",
      "start_frame": 4028,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 4160,
      "duration_frames": 132,
      "start_seconds": 134.266667,
      "end_seconds": 138.666667,
      "spoken_text": "Lifeboats and other debris were found. There were no survivors.",
      "first_word": "Lifeboats",
      "last_word": "survivors."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S27",
      "composition_source": "S27",
      "start_frame": 4160,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 4284,
      "duration_frames": 124,
      "start_seconds": 138.666667,
      "end_seconds": 142.8,
      "spoken_text": "All 29 people aboard the Edmund Fitzgerald had died.",
      "first_word": "All",
      "last_word": "died."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S28",
      "composition_source": "S28",
      "start_frame": 4284,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 4446,
      "duration_frames": 162,
      "start_seconds": 142.8,
      "end_seconds": 148.2,
      "spoken_text": "Later, search equipment located the wreck at a depth of about 160 meters.",
      "first_word": "Later,",
      "last_word": "meters."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S29",
      "composition_source": "S29",
      "start_frame": 4446,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 4625,
      "duration_frames": 179,
      "start_seconds": 148.2,
      "end_seconds": 154.166667,
      "spoken_text": "The ship lay in two main sections. The bow was upright, while the stern was upside down.",
      "first_word": "The",
      "last_word": "down."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S30",
      "composition_source": "S30",
      "start_frame": 4625,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 4781,
      "duration_frames": 156,
      "start_seconds": 154.166667,
      "end_seconds": 159.366667,
      "spoken_text": "But even the discovery of the wreck did not provide a final answer to the central question:",
      "first_word": "But",
      "last_word": "question:"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S31",
      "composition_source": "S31",
      "start_frame": 4781,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 4910,
      "duration_frames": 129,
      "start_seconds": 159.366667,
      "end_seconds": 163.666667,
      "spoken_text": "what exactly happened in those last few minutes? The United States Coast",
      "first_word": "what",
      "last_word": "Coast"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S32",
      "composition_source": "S32",
      "start_frame": 4910,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 5040,
      "duration_frames": 130,
      "start_seconds": 163.666667,
      "end_seconds": 168.0,
      "spoken_text": "Guard concluded that water had probably been entering the cargo hold gradually",
      "first_word": "Guard",
      "last_word": "gradually"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S33",
      "composition_source": "S33",
      "start_frame": 5040,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 5165,
      "duration_frames": 125,
      "start_seconds": 168.0,
      "end_seconds": 172.166667,
      "spoken_text": "through hatch covers that were not sufficiently watertight. As more water",
      "first_word": "through",
      "last_word": "water"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S34",
      "composition_source": "S34",
      "start_frame": 5165,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 5290,
      "duration_frames": 125,
      "start_seconds": 172.166667,
      "end_seconds": 176.333333,
      "spoken_text": "entered, the ship settled lower and lower in the lake. The National",
      "first_word": "entered,",
      "last_word": "National"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S35",
      "composition_source": "S35",
      "start_frame": 5290,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 5412,
      "duration_frames": 122,
      "start_seconds": 176.333333,
      "end_seconds": 180.4,
      "spoken_text": "Transportation Safety Board offered a different explanation for the final stage of the",
      "first_word": "Transportation",
      "last_word": "the"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S36",
      "composition_source": "S36",
      "start_frame": 5412,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 5552,
      "duration_frames": 140,
      "start_seconds": 180.4,
      "end_seconds": 185.066667,
      "spoken_text": "disaster. In its theory, water may also have been building up inside the",
      "first_word": "disaster.",
      "last_word": "the"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S37",
      "composition_source": "S37",
      "start_frame": 5552,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 5674,
      "duration_frames": 122,
      "start_seconds": 185.066667,
      "end_seconds": 189.133333,
      "spoken_text": "ship. Then one or more hatch covers gave way under water",
      "first_word": "ship.",
      "last_word": "water"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S38",
      "composition_source": "S38",
      "start_frame": 5674,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 5818,
      "duration_frames": 144,
      "start_seconds": 189.133333,
      "end_seconds": 193.933333,
      "spoken_text": "pressure. As a result, the cargo hold flooded rapidly.",
      "first_word": "pressure.",
      "last_word": "rapidly."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S39",
      "composition_source": "S39",
      "start_frame": 5818,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 5943,
      "duration_frames": 125,
      "start_seconds": 193.933333,
      "end_seconds": 198.1,
      "spoken_text": "These were the conclusions of investigations, not a record of the ship's final",
      "first_word": "These",
      "last_word": "final"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S40",
      "composition_source": "S40",
      "start_frame": 5943,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 6082,
      "duration_frames": 139,
      "start_seconds": 198.1,
      "end_seconds": 202.733333,
      "spoken_text": "moments. No one from the Fitzgerald returned to explain what happened.",
      "first_word": "moments.",
      "last_word": "happened."
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S41",
      "composition_source": "S41",
      "start_frame": 6082,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 6213,
      "duration_frames": 131,
      "start_seconds": 202.733333,
      "end_seconds": 207.1,
      "spoken_text": "We know the route it took, its final radio messages, and where the wreck lies",
      "first_word": "We",
      "last_word": "lies"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S42",
      "composition_source": "S42",
      "start_frame": 6213,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 6344,
      "duration_frames": 131,
      "start_seconds": 207.1,
      "end_seconds": 211.466667,
      "spoken_text": "today. But between the words We are holding our own and the loss of the",
      "first_word": "today.",
      "last_word": "the"
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "S43",
      "composition_source": "S43",
      "start_frame": 6344,
      "end_frame_exclusive": 6464,
      "duration_frames": 120,
      "start_seconds": 211.466667,
      "end_seconds": 215.466667,
      "spoken_text": "ship, there is still a gap that has never been fully reconstructed.",
      "first_word": "ship,",
      "last_word": "reconstructed."
    }
  ],
